      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have two main comments, but I\u0027m not going to block this CL from merging.\n1. This is a lot of functionality to add all at once.  It is preferred that you add functionality more incrementally.  For instance, UART console, battery/charger, AP power sequencing, etc.\n2. We have recently specified a new program/project layout that helps minimize code/devicetree duplication.  Details are here https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/docs/zephyr/project_config.md.  However, the intelrvp program hasn\u0027t yet been converted to the new format, so you\u0027re following the existing design pattern.",
      "revId": "73c980194d90d20c7aa8a62895f98f2c1044174b",
